    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just started lipitor for my cholesterol but i've been a huge grapefruit juice drinker my whole life like i have it every single morning. i heard there might be some interaction but i doubt it's a huge deal since i've always been fine. is it actually something i need to worry about?",
